      "message": "Initial test results after flashing:\n\n```\n\u003e runtest\nruntest\nRunning test_rtc_alarm...\n---Deep sleeps before: 0---\n---Deep sleeps after: 0---\nPass: 1 \u003d\u003d atomic_clear(\u0026rtc_fired)\nTarget delay was 500000us\nActual delay was 499938us\nThe delays are expected to be within +/- 500us\nPass: delay_us - delay_tol_us \u003c rtc_diff_us\nPass: rtc_diff_us \u003c delay_us + delay_tol_us\nOK\nRunning test_rtc_match_delay...\n---Deep sleeps before: 0---\n---Deep sleeps after: 0---\nExpected number of RTC alarm interrupts 5000\nActual number of RTC alarm interrupts 5000\nPass: rtc_match_delay_iterations \u003d\u003d atomic_clear(\u0026rtc_fired)\nOK\nPass!\n```\n\nAfter disconnecting power and J-Trace and then reconnecting power:\n\n```\n\u003e runtest\nruntest\nRunning test_rtc_alarm...\n---Deep sleeps before: 17---\n---Deep sleeps after: 0---\ntest/rtc_stm32f4.c:50: ASSERTION failed: 1 \u003d\u003d atomic_clear(\u0026rtc_fired)\n                EVAL: 1 \u003d\u003d 17\nFail\nRunning test_rtc_match_delay...\n---Deep sleeps before: 0---\n---Deep sleeps after: 0---\nExpected number of RTC alarm interrupts 5000\nActual number of RTC alarm interrupts 5000\nPass: rtc_match_delay_iterations \u003d\u003d atomic_clear(\u0026rtc_fired)\nOK\nFail! (1 tests)\n```\n\nResults after running `reboot`:\n\n```\n\u003e runtest\nruntest\nRunning test_rtc_alarm...\n---Deep sleeps before: 0---\n---Deep sleeps after: 0---\nPass: 1 \u003d\u003d atomic_clear(\u0026rtc_fired)\nTarget delay was 500000us\nActual delay was 499938us\nThe delays are expected to be within +/- 500us\nPass: delay_us - delay_tol_us \u003c rtc_diff_us\nPass: rtc_diff_us \u003c delay_us + delay_tol_us\nOK\nRunning test_rtc_match_delay...\n---Deep sleeps before: 0---\n---Deep sleeps after: 0---\nExpected number of RTC alarm interrupts 5000\nActual number of RTC alarm interrupts 5000\nPass: rtc_match_delay_iterations \u003d\u003d atomic_clear(\u0026rtc_fired)\nOK\nPass!\n```",
